{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"1112656e3b875c742bad9580b5131c51fa31d45054abad6bbe283267ca7d118e","slug":"ch03.intro","location":"/ch03/intro.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"第三章：逻辑内核重构","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Jin Lei","given":"Jin","family":"Lei"},"name":"Jin Lei","url":"https://jinlei.fewbody.com","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/blob/main/book/ch03/intro.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/edit/main/book/ch03/intro.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"intro.md","url":"/atomic/build/intro-df9df88afdca64f6b9eeb7063aecd5c5.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"当经典概念不再适用","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"hJmp1AIGmG"}],"identifier":"id","label":"当经典概念不再适用","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"V3loSc5Rdr"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在日常经验中，一个物体要么是一颗子弹，要么是一片水波，不可能同时是两者。子弹有确定的位置和轨迹，你可以用高速摄影追踪它的每一个瞬间；水波弥散在整片湖面上，没有一个确定的\"位置\"，但它可以绕过障碍物、穿过狭缝、与另一列波叠加产生干涉条纹。子弹和水波是两类截然不同的物理实体，它们服从不同的运动方程，遵循不同的行为逻辑。经典物理学的整个概念体系建立在这种清晰的二分法之上：粒子就是粒子，波就是波，两者泾渭分明。","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"rA5eIMWT04"}],"key":"EHroIUA0Y0"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"玻尔模型在氢原子光谱上取得了令人瞩目的成功，但它本质上仍是一个打了量子化补丁的经典模型：电子依然在确定的轨道上运行，依然拥有明确的位置和速度，只不过允许的轨道被离散化了。电子仍然是一颗\"小球\"——一颗只能在特定跑道上运动的小球，但终究是一颗小球。这种\"半经典\"的图景在解释更复杂的原子现象时很快碰壁，也无法自洽地回答一个根本性的问题：为什么电子在\"允许的轨道\"上就不辐射？玻尔的量子化条件是强加在经典力学之上的外部规则，就像在一套运行良好的软件中硬编码了几个特例——它能工作，但没有人知道为什么。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"gRpE1bdT9d"}],"key":"ePKmTIFMFe"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本章要做的事情远比打补丁更加激进。我们将彻底摧毁\"轨道\"这个经典概念本身，代之以一种全新的描述方式。微观粒子不是经典意义上的\"小球\"，也不是经典意义上的\"波\"，它同时继承了两者的属性，却在行为上超越了两者。描述它状态的不再是确定的位置和速度，而是一个概率密度函数——波函数。而你能从这个函数中提取多少信息，存在一个不可突破的基本极限：海森堡不确定关系。这不是对经典物理的小修小补，而是对整个概念框架的推倒重建。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"EYlekC5qzd"}],"key":"Bsm31F7oAA"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"硅基视角：从过程式到声明式","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"cfilCFqnin"}],"identifier":"id","label":"硅基视角：从过程式到声明式","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"cu0yRhRIS8"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如果把物理理论类比为编程范式，经典力学是一种典型的","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"kTOXuzOsLl"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"过程式编程","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"hpCMooqrhf"}],"key":"LPsvsjObW8"},{"type":"text","value":"(procedural programming)。你给出初始条件(位置和速度)，然后用牛顿方程一步一步地计算粒子在每个时刻的位置——就像用 for 循环逐步迭代。程序的核心逻辑是\"轨迹\"：粒子在 ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"uTCUNDlkCL"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"t = 0","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>","key":"WAYTDinRrL"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻在这里，","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"NzGK4mJRlb"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"t = \\Delta t","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span>","key":"rWHKZqhShj"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻在那里，","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"bIqXN0K47x"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"t = 2\\Delta t","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 2\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span>","key":"BL41KgIbCt"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻在更远的地方。轨迹是连续的、确定的、可追踪的。给定相同的初始条件，你总是得到相同的轨迹。这就是拉普拉斯决定论的编程表达：宇宙是一个纯函数(pure function)，没有副作用(side effects)，没有随机性。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"MLxumxog2i"}],"key":"dC0IZUUNkK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"量子力学则更像一种","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"l9ss2mgeU6"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"声明式编程","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"aXDh6sDML0"}],"key":"F02G5yF9R2"},{"type":"text","value":"(declarative programming)。你不再描述粒子\"如何运动\"(how)，而是描述粒子\"处于什么状态\"(what)。波函数 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"f7Weud9d3T"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\psi(x)","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>","key":"CM86QN8eXL"},{"type":"text","value":" 不告诉你粒子在哪里——它告诉你粒子在各个位置被找到的概率。你不是在计算一条轨迹，而是在查询一张概率分布表。程序的输出不再是确定性的数值，而是概率分布。运行同一个\"程序\"(相同的初始波函数)，每次\"执行\"(测量)可能得到不同的结果。过程式编程的核心数据结构是一个坐标点 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"WYhG2pVNci"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(x, p)","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>","key":"ElVNX077Xp"},{"type":"text","value":"；声明式编程的核心数据结构是一整个函数 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"XyzC7MAZrm"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\psi(x)","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>","key":"BU6rF9wpay"},{"type":"text","value":"，它包含的信息量远比一个坐标点丰富得多，但提取信息的方式也受到更多的限制。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"TBOM014feG"}],"key":"AihE7kX2dR"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这种范式转换的代价是巨大的。过程式编程的直觉是人类几千年生活经验的凝结——我们天生就能追踪运动的物体，预测抛射体的轨迹，理解碰撞和反弹。声明式编程则要求我们放弃这些直觉，接受一种全新的\"思维操作系统\"：粒子没有轨迹，只有概率云；测量不是被动地读取，而是主动地改变系统状态；两个看似矛盾的属性(波和粒子)可以共存于同一个对象之中。理解这种范式转换是进入量子力学世界的必经之路，也是本章的核心任务。","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"OGhEgoIFTS"}],"key":"XXY74TcsQB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"我们首先从波粒二象性出发，追溯光和电子如何在实验中展现出既是粒子又是波的双重面貌，以及德布罗意如何用一个大胆的假说将波动性推广到一切物质粒子。波粒二象性不是一个含糊的哲学概念，而是有着精确实验证据支撑的物理事实：同一束电子在康普顿散射实验中表现为粒子，在双缝实验中表现为波。然后，我们将深入讨论不确定关系的物理根源和数学结构，理解为什么位置和动量不可能同时精确确定，这不是测量技术的局限，而是自然界底层架构的设计规格。不确定关系在数学上与信号处理中的时频不确定性完全等价，这种跨学科的共鸣揭示了一个深刻的事实：不确定性不是量子力学的怪癖，而是任何基于波动描述的系统所必然具有的特征。最后，我们将讨论波函数的统计诠释，理解波函数作为\"状态数据库\"的角色，以及量子力学的内禀概率性如何引发了爱因斯坦与玻尔之间物理学史上最深刻的思想论战——一场关于\"上帝是否掷骰子\"的辩论，其最终裁决直到21世纪才通过贝尔不等式的实验检验而尘埃落定。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"QDIl7u1onW"}],"key":"zYQNILAOzJ"},{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"link","url":"/","internal":true,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"源代码：原子物理的逆向工程","key":"ESSqv6AlJ7"}],"urlSource":"/","key":"nuneXVowiU"}],"key":"yztMyfxeVc"},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"text","value":"前言","key":"LTARQGAVm3"},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"link","url":"/pre